# Third-party licenses

This file lists the licenses of all third-party crates used by net-tools.
It is generated by [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
from `about.toml` and `about.md.hbs`. **Do not edit it by hand.**

Regenerate with:

```bash
cargo install cargo-about --locked --features cli
cargo about generate about.md.hbs -o THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md
```

